  "batch_source": "@ECHO OFF\nP15SET C:\\OTHER > C:\\BAD.LOG\nIF NOT ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO BAD\nIF EXIST C:\\OTHER GOTO BAD\nIF EXIST C:\\P15EXP GOTO BAD\nP15SET > C:\\EXTRACT.LOG\nIF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO BAD\nECHO KEEP>C:\\P15EXP\\USER.TXT\nP15SET c:\\p15exp > C:\\RETRY.LOG\nIF ERRORLEVEL 1 GOTO BAD\nECHO PASS>C:\\DONE.TXT\nGOTO END\n:BAD\nECHO FAIL>C:\\DONE.TXT\n:END\nEXIT\n",
